<title>USA: Partial list of U.S. cult suicide victims.</title>
<headline>Partial list of U.S. cult suicide victims.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO SANTA FE, Calif. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of those victims of the mass suicide in San Diego whose families have been notified. Nine other victims names have not yet been disclosed.</p>
<p>Victims are listed by name, sex, age and the state in which their driver's licenses were issued.</p>
<p>Dana Abreo, female, 35, Colorado</p>
<p>Marshall Applewhite, male, 66, no driver's license</p>
<p>Robert Arancio, male, 46, Texas</p>
<p>Raymond Bowers, male, 45, Florida</p>
<p>Ladonna Brugato, female, 40, Colorado</p>
<p>Margaret Bull, female, 53, New Mexico</p>
<p>Cheryl Butcher, female, 43, Texas</p>
<p>Michael Carrier, male, 48, Texas</p>
